# Learner verification rules

Full spec: `@docs/learner-verification-flow.md` — read it before changing this area.

Hard rules:

- Two DOB sources: `dateOfBirthClaimed` (routing only) and `dateOfBirthVerified`
  (authoritative). The gate runs twice.
- Age is date-only UTC comparison. See `lib/verification/age.ts`.
- `resolveLearnerState()` in `lib/verification/state.ts` is the single source of
  truth for state. Do not branch on state anywhere else.
- Webhook handler dedupes on `(diditSessionId, decision)` before work.
- Guardian consent expires in 7 days. Expired consent → `GUARDIAN_EXPIRED`.
- `/onboarding/learner` is ONE page rendering 8 states. Do not split into routes.
